f products, benefits/services offerings, and pricing models when assisting customers, consultants, brokers, and/or channels.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Supports internal and external communication by: leading communications across teams to provide and obtain basic information to support the development of account strategy and implementation of strategic initiatives; leading problem-solving and communications across teams to advance the process of meeting deadlines and objectives; facilitating and leading communications with customer channels with advanced knowledge of health benefits/services strategy and offering and resolving external concerns; and participating in community of practice sessions including serving as a subject matter expert, sharing best practices, and/or supporting managers in coaching team members.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Ambiguity/Uncertainty Management","source_heading":"Knowledge, Skills and Abilities: (Core)","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Benefits/Services","source_heading":"Knowledge, Skills and Abilities: (Functional)","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Attention to Detail","source_heading":"Knowledge, Skills and Abilities: (Core)","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Customer Data","source_heading":"Knowledge, Skills and Abilities: (Functional)","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Business Knowledge","source_heading":"Knowledge, Skills and Abilities: (Core)","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Customer Experience","source_heading":"Knowledge, Skills and Abilities: (Functional)","so